          "value": "{\"token\":\"hWNIr6BvMUD3eq9ELh0R0ZhT?key=5d937e63b960b1a2766b1ef0fac973ef\",\"note\":\"\",\"attributes\":{\"_heatVid\":\"611062111561640096\",\"_heatIdSite\":1781,\"_heatDevice\":2,\"_heatUid\":\"eieqmia62yqqiaa2\"},\"original_total_price\":6000,\"total_price\":6000,\"total_discount\":0,\"total_weight\":364,\"item_count\":1,\"items\":[{\"id\":55063890395514,\"properties\":{},\"quantity\":1,\"variant_id\":55063890395514,\"key\":\"55063890395514:ac96debd9c53f9901f4d53ea81a58f1e\",\"title\":\"AIRI Waterless Diffuser - White / AIRI + 3 Essential Oils\",\"price\":6000,\"original_price\":6000,\"presentment_price\":60,\"discounted_price\":6000,\"line_price\":6000,\"original_line_price\":6000,\"total_discount\":0,\"discounts\":[],\"sku\":\"M-MP-ACL-XM080\",\"grams\":364,\"vendor\":\"Nikura\",\"taxable\":true,\"product_id\":14959740289402,\"product_has_only_default_variant\":false,\"gift_card\":false,\"final_price\":6000,\"final_line_price\":6000,\"url\":\"/products/airi-waterless-diffuser?variant=55063890395514\",\"featured_image\":{\"aspect_ratio\":1.134,\"alt\":\"AIRI Waterless Diffuser\",\"height\":1794,\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0017/5839/6473/files/Copy_of_NEW_PDP_16.jpg?v=1787071021\",\"width\":2034},\"image\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0017/5839/6473/files/Copy_of_NEW_PDP_16.jpg?v=1787071021\",\"handle\":\"airi-waterless-diffuser\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"product_type\":\"Diffusers\",\"product_title\":\"AIRI Waterless Diffuser\",\"product_description\":\"Description\\n\\nWaterless, Wireless, Portable, Silent.\u00a0\\nCreating a calming, stress-free atmosphere at home is easier than you think with our new AIRI waterless diffuser.\\nAIRI uses Ultra Nebulisation Technology to diffuse your oils directly into your home. No water, no dilution, just the full strength of your oils. With even, efficient coverage that fills the largest rooms effortlessly, you can use the power of scent to transform your space into your very own sanctuary.\\nSetting up AIRI takes seconds. Insert your oil directly and you're ready to go. Completely silent and fully portable, plus three mist settings to suit your mood.\\nWhats Inside\\nEach bundle comes with one AIRI diffuser, and a USB-C Charging Cable. Always use the USB-C cable supplied as other cables may not charge the unit correctly.\\nEssential Oil Classics Bundle (3 x 10ml)A timeless trio of Lavender, Lemon, and Peppermint, blending calming, uplifting, and invigorating aromas for everyday wellbeing.\\nSleep Blends Bundle (3 x 10ml)Our top three blends for a peaceful night\u2019s sleep: Calm, Cosy Night In, and Sweet Dreams. Crafted to relax the mind, comfort the senses, and promote restful sleep.\\nBest Sellers Bundle (5 x 10ml)A curated collection of our five most-loved scents: Lemon, Lavender, Peppermint, Fresh Linen, and Calm.\\nHow it works\u00a0\\nPress the on button to start or stop diffusion. Press it again to cycle through run times of\u00a01h \u2192 3h \u2192 6h.\\nA second button cycles through low, medium and high intensity, releasing a 1.2-second burst every 210, 150 or 90 seconds. To turn the light off, hold down the same button at any time.\u00a0\\nThe indicator light confirms your settings, and it shuts off automatically when the timer's done.\\nFor best results, place AIRI towards the edge of a surface so the mist can disperse freely into the room.\\nSpecifications\\n\\n\\nCharging Time:\u00a02-3 hours for a full charge\\n\\nPower: 5W with included USB/AC adapter\\n\\nCoverage Area: Up to 60m\u00b2\\n\\nBattery: 800mAh Lithium\\n\\nSafety: Auto shutoff when battery drops below 5%\\n\\n\\nAIRI User Manual PDF\\nCompatible with 10ml, 20ml, 30ml and 50ml bottles. Do not use with high viscosity oils.\",\"variant_title\":\"White / AIRI + 3 Essential Oils\",\"variant_options\":[\"White\",\"AIRI + 3 Essential Oils\"],\"options_with_values\":[{\"name\":\"Colour\",\"value\":\"White\"},{\"name\":\"Set\",\"value\":\"AIRI + 3 Essential Oils\"}]